<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="loc-grid" data-stagger><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-near-you/portland/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/portland-downtown.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/portland-downtown-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/portland-downtown.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><b>Portland</b><small>Multnomah County</small></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-near-you/beaverton/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-dusk.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-dusk-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-dusk.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><b>Beaverton</b><small>Washington County</small></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-near-you/hillsboro/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/barn-valley.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/barn-valley-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/barn-valley.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><b>Hillsboro</b><small>Washington County</small></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-near-you/lake-oswego/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hood-lake.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hood-lake-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hood-lake.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="813" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><b>Lake Oswego</b><small>Clackamas County</small></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-near-you/salem/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/salem-capitol.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/salem-capitol-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/salem-capitol.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><b>Salem</b><small>Marion County</small></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-near-you/eugene/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/siuslaw-winter.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/siuslaw-winter-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/siuslaw-winter.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="682" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><b>Eugene</b><small>Lane County</small></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-near-you/corvallis/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calapooia-winter.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calapooia-winter-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calapooia-winter.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><b>Corvallis</b><small>Benton County</small></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-near-you/bend/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/bend-drake-park.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/bend-drake-park-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/bend-drake-park.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="679" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><b>Bend</b><small>Deschutes County</small></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-near-you/medford/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-street.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-street-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire-street.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="684" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><b>Medford</b><small>Jackson County</small></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-near-you/grants-pass/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-crew.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-crew-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire-crew.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><b>Grants Pass</b><small>Josephine County</small></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-near-you/newport/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/cannon-beach.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/cannon-beach-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/cannon-beach.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><b>Newport</b><small>Lincoln County</small></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/appraisal-near-you/pendleton/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-hills.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-hills-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-hills.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="960" height="636" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><b>Pendleton</b><small>Umatilla County</small></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head solo rv"><div><span class="kicker">Regions</span><h2>How claims differ across Oregon</h2><p>The same policy wording plays out very differently in a Portland bungalow, a Bend vacation home and a Newport beach cottage.</p></div></div><div class="index-list" data-stagger><div class="index-card rv"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hero-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hero-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hero-home.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="1024" height="814" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Region 01</span><h2>Portland Metro</h2><p>Oregon’s busiest claim market. Ice storms in 2021 and 2024 brought down trees across Multnomah County, Washington County and Clackamas County, and older housing makes every repair more expensive.</p><p style="margin-top:10px;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)">Portland, Beaverton, Hillsboro, Lake Oswego, Gresham</p></span></div><div class="index-card rv"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calapooia-winter.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calapooia-winter-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calapooia-winter.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="1024" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Region 02</span><h2>Willamette Valley</h2><p>From Salem to Eugene, big-leaf maples and Douglas firs meet winter storms. The 2019 snowstorm and the 2020 Labor Day fires both left deep marks.</p><p style="margin-top:10px;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)">Salem, Eugene, Corvallis, Albany, Springfield</p></span></div><div class="index-card rv"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/coast-waves.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/coast-waves-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/coast-waves.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Region 03</span><h2>Oregon Coast</h2><p>The 2007 Great Coastal Gale set the benchmark. Wind-driven rain and salt air shape every roof and siding argument from Astoria to Brookings.</p><p style="margin-top:10px;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)">Newport, Lincoln City, Seaside, Coos Bay, Astoria</p></span></div><div class="index-card rv"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-forest.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-forest-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire-forest.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Region 04</span><h2>Southern Oregon</h2><p>The Almeda Fire swept from Ashland toward Medford in 2020. Wildfire, smoke and heat now drive many Rogue Valley claims.</p><p style="margin-top:10px;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)">Medford, Grants Pass, Ashland, Roseburg, Klamath Falls</p></span></div><div class="index-card rv"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/crooked-river.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/crooked-river-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/crooked-river.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="1024" height="821" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Region 05</span><h2>Central Oregon</h2><p>High-desert winters and summer thunderstorms. Many second homes sit empty for weeks, which changes how frozen-pipe claims play out.</p><p style="margin-top:10px;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)">Bend, Redmond, Sisters, Sunriver, Prineville</p></span></div><div class="index-card rv"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-hills.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-hills-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-hills.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 240px" width="960" height="636" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ib"><span class="k">Region 06</span><h2>Eastern Oregon</h2><p>Wheat country and ranch land, where hail and downbursts damage roofs, siding and outbuildings.</p><p style="margin-top:10px;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)">Pendleton, Hermiston, La Grande, Baker City, Ontario</p></span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap"><div class="in rv"><div><h2>Don’t see your city?</h2><p>We cover every Oregon county. Call and tell us where the property is.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line" href="/reach-an-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></div></section>
